documentation_complete: true

title: '64-bit Kernel Module Audit Rules Suffice'

description: |-
    Whether the audit rules for the 64-bit kernel module calls suffice on a
    64-bit system, without the rules for the 32-bit calls. The CIS
    Benchmarks list the 64-bit rules only.

type: boolean

operator: equals

interactive: false

options:
    default: false
    false: false
    true: true
